-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">ligne 437</span> de <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">trouver-ma-ville.astro</code>.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Nous allons simplement remplacer le passage situé entre la description de la commune et le prix au m².</p><h3 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold">1. Repère ces deux lignes</h3><div><div class="CodeBlock-zu1QM3"><div data-markdown-copy="code-block" class="relative w-full min-w-0 overflow-clip contain-inline-size rounded-(--radius-3xl-base) border border-subtle bg-secondary-soft-alpha Surface-dfq13n light @container" data-theme="light" data-search-result-target=""><div data-markdown-copy="exclude" class="flex items-center font-sans text-sm select-none min-h-12 gap-2 py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-medium text-default md:ps-5 sticky z-10 StickyActionBar-XvAQxh"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4.46951 6.27289C4.68734 5.97727 5.10354 5.91356 5.3992 6.13129C5.69464 6.34921 5.75762 6.76637 5.53982 7.06195L3.32791 10.0639L5.5369 13.0131C5.75668 13.3071 5.69695 13.7237 5.40311 13.9438C5.10923 14.1637 4.69261 14.1037 4.47244 13.81L2.04178 10.5639C1.82214 10.2704 1.8206 9.86789 2.03787 9.57269L4.46951 6.27289Z" fill="currentColor"></path> <path d="M14.6053 6.13129C14.9009 5.9136 15.3171 5.97728 15.5349 6.27289L17.9666 9.57269C18.1837 9.86787 18.1823 10.2705 17.9627 10.5639L15.532 13.81C15.312 14.1038 14.8953 14.1635 14.6013 13.9438C14.3074 13.7237 14.2476 13.3071 14.4676 13.0131L16.6765 10.0639L14.4646 7.06195C14.2468 6.76628 14.3096 6.34915 14.6053 6.13129Z" fill="currentColor"></path> <path d="M11.0584 6.37347C11.2205 6.04395 11.6194 5.90772 11.949 6.06976C12.2782 6.23191 12.4135 6.63003 12.2517 6.95941L8.94119 13.6928C8.77923 14.0222 8.381 14.1581 8.05154 13.9965C7.72196 13.