  </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">?</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"En bord de mer"</span><span>
  </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">:</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"Environ "</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">+</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">commune</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>mer </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">+</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">" minutes"</span><span>}</span></code></pre></div></div></div><button class="cursor-interaction absolute z-30 flex h-8 w-8 translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-default bg-surface bg-clip-padding text-secondary transition-opacity duration-basic ease-in-out end-1/2 print:hidden pointer-events-none opacity-0 bottom-4" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Faire défiler jusqu’en bas" tabindex="-1" type="button"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon rotate-180 text-default"><path d="M9.33467 16.6663V4.93978L4.6374 9.63704L4.1667 9.16634L3.69599 8.69661L9.52998 2.86263L9.63447 2.77767C9.8925 2.60753 10.2433 2.63564 10.4704 2.86263L16.3034 8.69661L16.3884 8.80111C16.5588 9.05922 16.5306 9.40982 16.3034 9.63704C16.0762 9.86414 15.7255 9.89242 15.4675 9.722L15.363 9.63704L10.6647 4.9388V16.6663C10.6647 17.0336 10.367 17.3314 9.99971 17.3314C9.63259 17.3312 9.33467 17.0335 9.33467 16.6663ZM4.6374 9.63704C4.3777 9.89674 3.95569 9.89674 3.69599 9.63704C3.43657 9.37744 3.43668 8.95628 3.69599 8.69661L4.6374 9.63704Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Conserve bien les paragraphes du coût estimé et du budget.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Enregistre avec <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">Ctrl + S</code>.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-componen