</span></code></pre></div></div></div><button class="cursor-interaction absolute z-30 flex h-8 w-8 translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-default bg-surface bg-clip-padding text-secondary transition-opacity duration-basic ease-in-out end-1/2 print:hidden pointer-events-none opacity-0 bottom-4" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Faire défiler jusqu’en bas" tabindex="-1" type="button"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon rotate-180 text-default"><path d="M9.33467 16.6663V4.93978L4.6374 9.63704L4.1667 9.16634L3.69599 8.69661L9.52998 2.86263L9.63447 2.77767C9.8925 2.60753 10.2433 2.63564 10.4704 2.86263L16.3034 8.69661L16.3884 8.80111C16.5588 9.05922 16.5306 9.40982 16.3034 9.63704C16.0762 9.86414 15.7255 9.89242 15.4675 9.722L15.363 9.63704L10.6647 4.9388V16.6663C10.6647 17.0336 10.367 17.3314 9.99971 17.3314C9.63259 17.3312 9.33467 17.0335 9.33467 16.6663ZM4.6374 9.63704C4.3777 9.89674 3.95569 9.89674 3.69599 9.63704C3.43657 9.37744 3.43668 8.95628 3.69599 8.69661L4.6374 9.63704Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Ne touche pas aux autres paragraphes : la distance de la mer, le coût estimé et le budget sont maintenant correctement écrits dans le code que tu m'as envoyé.</p><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-border="" style="border: 1px solid rgb(38, 155, 105); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);"><div class="Badge-_iijmO Badge-G_joSy" data-color="success" data-size="sm" data-pill="" data-variant="soft" data-d-component="badge" data-d-weight="medium">Résultat attendu</div><h1 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="xl" data-d-weight="semibold">Cambrils</h1><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Ville côtière avec un port, des plages et des commerces ouverts toute l'année.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Distance de la mer :</span> En bord de mer</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Prix moyen au m² :</span> 2 378,66 €</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Coût estimé :</span> 190 293 €</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Budget :</span> Compatible avec votre budget estimé</p></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Enregistre avec <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">Ctrl + S</code>, puis actualise ton questionnaire et relance une recherche.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Dis-moi « fait » lorsque les informations apparaissent dans le bon ordre.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side