ono text-size-code text-default md:px-5 ViewerContent-Cg8AgN pt-0 min-w-max whitespace-pre"><code><span>
.</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">resultats</span><span> {
  display: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">grid</span><span>;
  grid-template-columns: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">repeat</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">auto-fit</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">minmax</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">280</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">fr</span><span>));
  gap: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">24</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
  margin-top: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">30</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">resultat-card</span><span> {
  background: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">white</span><span>;
  padding: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">25</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
  border-radius: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">14</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
  box-shadow: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">4</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">18</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0.08</span><span>);
  border: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">solid</span><span> #e5e7eb;
}

.</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">resultat-card</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">h3</span><span> {
  color: #176b78;
  font-size: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1.5</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">rem</span><span>;
  margin-top: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">resultat-card</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">p</span><span> {
  line-height: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1.6</span><span>;
  margin: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">12</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>;
}
</span></code></pre></div></div></div><button class="cursor-interaction absolute z-30 flex h-8 w-8 translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-default bg-surface bg-clip-padding text-secondary transition-opacity duration-basic ease-in-out end-1/2 print:hidden pointer-events-none opacity-0 bottom-4" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Faire défiler jusqu’en bas" tabindex="-1" type="button"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon rotate-180 text-default"><path d="M9.33467 16.6663V4.93978L4.6374 9.63704L4.1667 9.16634L3.69599 8.69661L9.52998 2.86263L9.63447 2.77767C9.8925 2.60753 10.2433 2.63564 10.4704 2.86263L16.3034 8.69661L16.3884 8.80111C16.5588 9.05922 16.5306 9.40982 16.3034 9.63704C16.0762 9.86414 15.7255 9.89242 15.4675 9.722L15.363 9.63704L10.6647 4.9388V16.6663C10.6647 17.0336 10.367 17.3314 9.99971 17.3314C9.63259 17.3312 9.33467 17.0335 9.33467 16.6663ZM4.6374 9.63704C4.3777 9.89674 3.95569 9.89674 3.69599 9.63704C3.43657 9.37744 3.43668 8.95628 3.69599 8.69661L4.6374 9.63704Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Si ton fichier possède déjà des règles <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">.resultats</code> ou <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">.resultat-card</code>, remplace-les plutôt que de les dupliquer.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Attention :</span> comme les fiches sont créées par JavaScript, si tu utilises <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">&lt;style&gt;</code> dans Astro, remplace-le par <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">&lt;style is:global&gt;</code> pour que les styles s'appliquent bien aux résultats.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Enregistre avec <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">Ctrl + S</code>, puis relance une recherche. Tu devrais voir les trois communes présentées dans des cartes côte à côte sur ordinateur et empilées sur téléphone.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Nous ajouterons ensuite les photos et le bouton de contact.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 electron:[&amp;&gt;svg]:icon-sm flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-label="Copier"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-xs"><path d="M13.468 11.1216C13.468 10.4107 13.468 9.91717 13.4367 9.53369C13.4137 9.25191 13.3758 9.0622 13.3244 8.91846L13.2687 8.78858C13.1148 8.48652 12.8803 8.23344 12.593 8.05713L12.466 7.98584C12.308 7.90546 12.0963 7.84854 11.7209 7.81787C11.3374 7.78656 10.8439 7.78662 10.133 7.78662H7.29999C6.58895 7.78662 6.09562 7.78654 5.7121 7.81787C5.43015 7.84091 5.24064 7.87872 5.09686 7.93018L4.96698 7.98584C4.664