 <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">.resultat-card</code>. Ce n'est pas grave, mais nous allons nettoyer le CSS pour éviter les conflits et conserver une seule version.</p><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">Étape 26 — Nettoyer le CSS</h2><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Dans <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">src/pages/trouver-ma-ville.astro</code>, <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">conserve tout le code jusqu'à la fin de la règle <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">button</code></span>.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Ensuite, remplace tout ce qui commence à <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">#resultat {</code> jusqu'à la fin des règles CSS que tu viens de m'envoyer par ce bloc unique :</p><div><div class="CodeBlock-zu1QM3"><div data-markdown-copy="code-block" class="relative w-full min-w-0 overflow-clip contain-inline-size rounded-(--radius-3xl-base) border border-subtle bg-secondary-soft-alpha Surface-dfq13n light @container" data-theme="light" data-search-result-target=""><div data-markdown-copy="exclude" class="flex items-center font-sans text-sm select-none min-h-12 gap-2 py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-medium text-default md:ps-5 sticky z-10 StickyActionBar-XvAQxh"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4.46951 6.27289C4.68734 5.97727 5.10354 5.91356 5.3992 6.13129C5.69464 6.34921 5.75762 6.76637 5.53982 7.06195L3.32791 10.0639L5.5369 13.0131C5.75668 13.3071 5.69695 13.7237 5.40311 13.9438C5.10923 14.1637 4.69261 14.1037 4.47244 13.81L2.04178 10.5639C1.82214 10.2704 1.8206 9.86789 2.03787 9.57269L4.46951 6.27289Z" fill="currentColor"></path> <path d="M14.6053 6.13129C14.9009 5.9136 15.3171 5.9