23C8.10917 3.11523 7.33203 3.89237 7.33203 4.85059V5.95215H10.9336C12.6262 5.95229 13.998 7.32491 13.998 9.01758V12.6182H15.1006C16.0584 12.6178 16.8348 11.8416 16.835 10.8838V4.85059C16.835 3.89262 16.0585 3.11564 15.1006 3.11523H9.06738Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></span></div></div></div><div class="relative [container-type:inline-size]"><div class="InlineCodePane-EYx4bd w-full overflow-x-hidden"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full" dir="ltr"><div class="chatgpt-code-scrollport flex w-full items-stretch overscroll-x-contain overflow-x-auto"><pre class="m-0 flex-1 cursor-text px-4 pb-3 font-mono text-size-code text-default md:px-5 ViewerContent-Cg8AgN pt-0 min-w-max whitespace-pre"><code><span>
</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">#</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">resultat</span><span> {
  margin-top: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">45</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
}

</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">#</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">resultat</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">h2</span><span> {
  text-align: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">center</span><span>;
  color: #167b88;
  margin-bottom: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">30</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">resultats</span><span> {
  display: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">grid</span><span>;
  grid-template-columns: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">repeat</span><span>(
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">auto-fit</span><span>,
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">minmax</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">min</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">100</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">%</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">280</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>), </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">fr</span><span>)
  );
  gap: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">24</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
  margin-top: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">30</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">resultat-card</span><span> {
  background: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">white</span><span>;
  padding: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">25</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
  border-radius: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">14</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
  border: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">solid</span><span> #e5e7eb;
  border-top: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">5</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">solid</span><span> #167b88;
  box-shadow: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">4</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">18</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0.08</span><span>);
}

.</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">resultat-card</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">h3</span><span> {
  color: #176b78;
  font-size: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">24</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
  margin-top: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">resultat-card</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">p</span><span> {
  line-height: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1.6</span><span>;
  margin: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">12</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>;
}
</span></code></pre></div></div></div><button class="cursor-interaction absolute z-30 flex h-8 w-8 translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-default bg-surface bg-clip-padding text-secondary transition-opacity duration-basic ease-in-out end-1/2 print:hidden pointer-events-none opacity-0 bottom-4" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Faire défiler jusqu’en bas" tabindex="-1" type="button"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon rotate-180 text-default"><path d="M9.33467 16.6663V4.93978L4.6374 9.63704L4.1667 9.16634L3.69599 8.69661L9.52998 2.86263L9.63447 2.77767C9.8925 2.60753 10.2433 2.63564 10.4704 2.86263L16.3034 8.69661L16.3884 8.80111C16.5588 9.05922 16.5306 9.40982 16.3034 9.63704C16.0762 9.86414 15.7255 9.89242 15.4675 9.722L15.363 9.63704L10.6647 4.9388V16.6663C10.6647 17.0336 10.367 17.3314 9.99971 17.3314C9.63259 17.3312 9.33467 17.0335 9.33467 16.6663ZM4.6374 9.63704C4.3777 9.89674 3.95569 9.89674 3.69599 9.63704C3.43657 9.37744 3.43668 8.95628 3.69599 8.69661L4.6374 9.63704Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Vérifie également que la balise ouvrante du bloc est bien <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">&lt;style is:global&gt;</code> et qu'il se termine par <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">&lt;/style&gt;</code>. Cela permet aux styles de s'appliquer aux fiches générées par JavaScript.</p><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">Voici le résultat visuel attendu</h2><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-theme="light" style="--smoothing-background-color: #eef6f6; border-radius: var(--radius-xl); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: rgb(238, 246, 246); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);"><h1 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="xl" data-d-weight="semibold" data-d-text-align="center" style="color: rgb(23, 107, 120);">Les communes correspondant à votre recherche</h1><div class="Grid-CGRmTR" data-d-component="grid" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0px, 1fr));"><div class="Box-qIMv6G Item-ev4eoI" data-d-component="grid-item" data-d-direction="col" data-d-variant="transparent" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); --grid-item-column: auto; --grid-item-row: auto;"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-border="" style="--smoothing-background-color: #ffffff; border-block-end: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); border-block-start: 5px solid rgb(22, 123, 136); border-inline: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);"><h1 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="xl" data-d-weight="semibold" style="color: rgb(23, 107, 120);">Cambrils</h1><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-size="sm" style="color: rgb(51, 65, 85);">Ville côtière avec un port, des plages et des commerces ouverts toute l'année.</p><div class="Divider-WkGDyu" data-d-component="divider" style="--divider-color: var(--color-border); --divider-size: 1px;"></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-size="sm" style="color: rgb(51, 65, 85);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-waves" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: text-bottom;"><path d="M2 6c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1C7 7 7 5 9.5 5c2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1"></path><path d="M2 12c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1"></path><path d="M2 18c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1"></path></svg> En bord de mer</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-size="sm" style="color: rgb(51, 65, 85);">Prix moyen : 2 378,66 €/m²</p><h1 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="xl" data-d-weight="semibold" style="color: rgb(23, 107, 120);">190 293 €</h1><div class="Badge-_iijmO Badge-G_joSy" data-color="success" data-size="sm" data-pill="" data-variant="soft" data-d-component="badge" data-d-weight="medium">Budget compatible</div></div></div><div class="Box-qIMv6G Item-ev4eoI" data-d-component="grid-item" data-d-direction="col" data-d-variant="transparent" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); --grid-item-column: auto; --grid-item-row: auto;"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-border="" style="--smoothing-background-color: #ffffff; border-block-end: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); border-block-start: 5px solid rgb(22, 123, 136); border-inline: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);"><h1 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="xl" data-d-weight="semibold" style="color: rgb(23, 107, 120);">Salou</h1><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-size="sm" style="color: rgb(51, 65, 85);">Station balnéaire animée, avec de nombreux appartements de vacances.</p><div class="Divider-WkGDyu" data-d-component="divider" style="--divider-color: var(--color-border); --divider-size: 1px;"></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-size="sm" style="color: rgb(51, 65, 85);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-waves" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: text-bottom;"><path d="M2 6c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1C7 7 7 5 9.5 5c2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1"></path><path d="M2 12c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1"></path><path d="M2 18c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1"></path></svg> En bord de mer</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-size="sm" style="color: rgb(51, 65, 85);">Prix moyen : 2 422,11 €/m²</p><h1 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="xl" data-d-weight="semibold" style="color: rgb(23, 107, 120);">193 769 €</h1><div class="Badge-_iijmO Badge-G_joSy" data-color="success" data-size="sm" data-pill="" data-variant="soft" data-d-component="badge" data-d-weight="medium">Budget compatible</div></div></div></div><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Caption-VSNpzV" data-d-component="caption" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="normal" style="color: rgb(100, 116, 139);">Aperçu illustratif à partir des prix de ta base actuelle.</span></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Enregistre avec <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">Ctrl + S</code>, actualise la page et relance une recherche.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Envoie-moi une capture du résultat.</span> Nous vérifierons que les trois communes s'affichent bien dans des cartes avant d'ajouter leurs photos.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 electron:[&amp;&gt;svg]:icon-sm flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-label="Copier"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-xs"><path d="M13.468 11.1216C13.4