0998 5.58672 12.2526L5.47539 12.3991C5.38197 12.5358 5.30159 12.6812 5.23516 12.8327L5.17363 12.9869C5.1333 13.0971 5.1025 13.2125 5.06817 13.3815L4.94121 14.0983L4.54277 16.4918L4.5418 16.4938H4.54473L6.93828 16.0944L7.65508 15.9684C7.82408 15.9341 7.93949 15.9033 8.04961 15.8629L8.20293 15.8014C8.35464 15.7349 8.49956 15.6538 8.63652 15.5602L8.78399 15.4498C8.93677 15.3239 9.12233 15.1398 9.47149 14.7907L14.4588 9.80238L11.2332 6.57679L6.2459 11.5651ZM15.7635 5.27308C14.9282 4.43776 13.6058 4.38573 12.7098 5.11683L12.5369 5.27308L12.1736 5.63636L15.4002 8.86195L15.7635 8.49964L15.9197 8.32581C16.6016 7.48961 16.6016 6.28311 15.9197 5.44691L15.7635 5.27308Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block-BQZwFn"><span hidden="" data-chatgpt-agent-turn-start=""></span><div data-content-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-33:1:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-33:1:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-message-ids="90b34272-56ab-43e8-8646-3b63f709884a 90b34272-56ab-43e8-8646-3b63f709884a"><h4 class="sr-only m-0 select-none" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1">ChatGPT a dit :</h4><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="6ab4238e-345c-83ed-bdc0-49bd30370c07" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="90b34272-56ab-43e8-8646-3b63f709884a"><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_2qt_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden"><div><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="light" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh LegacyReveal-lIiswq" data-d-direction="col"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Parfait Bobby ! Les trois communes s'affichent maintenant dans de belles cartes, avec les bonnes informations. Nous allons pouvoir ajouter les photos.</p><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">Étape 27 — Ajouter une photo à chaque commune</h2><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Pour commencer, nous allons utiliser la photo de Cambrils que tu as déjà placée dans <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">public/images/cambrils.jpg</code>.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">1. Ouvre le fichier</span> <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">src/data/communes.json</code>.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Dans la fiche de Cambrils, ajoute cette ligne juste après son nom :</p><div><div class="CodeBlock-zu1QM3"><div data-markdown-copy="code-block" class="relative w-full min-w-0 overflow-clip contain-inline-size rounded-(--radius-3xl-base) border border-subtle bg-secondary-soft-alpha Surface-dfq13n light @container" data-theme="light" data-search-result-target=""><div data-markdown-copy="exclude" class="flex items-center font-sans text-sm select-none min-h-12 gap-2 py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-medium text-default md:ps-5 sticky z-10 StickyActionBar-XvAQxh"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4.46951 6.27289C4.68734 5.97727 5.10354 5.91356 5.3992 6.13129C5.69464 6.34921 5.75762 6.76637 5.53982 7.06195L3.32791 10.0639L5.5369 13.0131C5.75668 13.3071 5.69695 13.7237 5.40311 13.9438C5.10923 14.1637 4.69261 14.1037 4.47244 13.81L2.04178 10.5639C1.82214 10.2704 1.8206 9.86789 2.03787 9.57269L4.46951 6.27289Z" fill="currentColor"></path>