"><img alt="Cambrils Holidays 2026/2027 | loveholidays" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" class="Image-LDLXtM Image-eK79_D LoadingImage-HroCZg" data-loaded="" draggable="false" src="./montbrio_files/_-Y8ibmIqL039AdL4b74mOTfFVz6wuGdPnGt25FRjMcBwmLCcYnoKgZM6rev9ufw0BdWeJgsOjcd7oP6XmZRiZGSGglaxGCRjyLM5tFVRUkmmGoOBH2UvprOLKB_ClI2pBr1NxsoDrXqE7n9qxbsxhexJ-gSq84JzUU8H18_YB8ZMpFkma7raIEjETjUtUBl" style="border-radius: 0px; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; height: 100%; width: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 0% 50%;"><div class="LoadingSurface-lReVUi" data-d-image-loading=""><div class="Box-qIMv6G LoadingBlock-IP9PHY" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="loading-block" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-width="" data-d-has-height="" style="--smoothing-background-color: light-dark(var(--dil-image-loading-light-bg, var(--theme-user-msg-bg, var(--color-background-info-surface))), var(--theme-user-msg-bg, var(--color-background-info-surface))); background-color: light-dark(var(--dil-image-loading-light-bg, var(--theme-user-msg-bg, var(--color-background-info-surface))), var(--theme-user-msg-bg, var(--color-background-info-surface))); flex-shrink: 0; height: 100%; width: 100%; --loading-block-duration: 1000ms;"></div></div><div class="Overlay-PoiQIi"><button class="Box-qIMv6G Pressable-KyqH6M" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="pressable" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-width="" data-d-has-height="" aria-label="Open Cambrils Holidays 2026/2027 | loveholidays" type="button" style="--smoothing-background-color: transparent; border-radius: 0px; background-color: transparent; flex-shrink: 0; height: 100%; width: 100%;"></button></div></div></div><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="--w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);"><div class="Badge-_iijmO Badge-G_joSy" data-color="success" data-size="sm" data-pill="" data-variant="soft" data-d-component="badge" data-d-weight="medium">Aperçu illustratif</div><h1 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="2xl" data-d-weight="semibold">Cambrils</h1><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Ville côtière avec un port, des plages et des commerces ouverts toute l'année.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Distance de la mer :</span> En bord de mer</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Prix moyen au m² :</span> 2 378,66 €</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Coût estimé :</span> 190 293 €</p></div></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Enregistre avec <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">Ctrl + S</code>, puis actualise ton questionnaire et relance une recherche.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">La carte de Cambrils devrait maintenant afficher sa photo. Les autres communes resteront sans image tant que nous n'aurons pas ajouté leurs fichiers.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Dis-moi « fait » lorsque la photo apparaît.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate