ambrils, sans modifier les calculs ni la présentation des cartes.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Dans Visual Studio Code, ouvre le dossier <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">public/images</code> et ajoutes-y progressivement les photos des communes.</p><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-border="" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-align="start" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-clip="true" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-border="" data-d-has-height="" style="--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); flex-shrink: 0; height: auto; max-width: 100%; min-width: 0px; width: 112px;"><div class="Image-eK79_D OverlayBox-vnB7gO LoadingFrame-p8B6Sc" data-d-component="image" style="border-radius: 0px; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; height: 100%; width: 100%; overflow: hidden;"><img alt="Salou is a hidden gem on Costa Dorada in Catalonia - Explore Spain Guide" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" class="Image-LDLXtM Image-eK79_D LoadingImage-HroCZg" data-loaded="" draggable="false" src="./montbrio_files/wwuQPtnGs8wHmXAW1gK2_-iTXH7g_xIymOYn4OW7YcYg8_DWoJ-a35gpjp4ow-II-ysYshTZ8-cWrVF0bkBO1kqB6j7zZKAQXCFvH_Vk2suaof9vSAR1zi0EhR8ykK1zh9BeMuTEkMuFxXj